  "steps": [
    "Add the boiled soya chunks, green peas, spinach, green chillies and garlic to a blender. Blend using pulse mode.",
    "Transfer to a bowl and add besan, red chilli powder, salt and white sesame seeds. Mix well.",
    "Take a small portion of the mixture, flatten it, stuff with a cheese cube and shape into a ball.",
    "Coat each ball with breadcrumbs.",
    "Air fry at 180°C for 25 minutes, or until golden and crispy. You can also deep-fry them or cook them in an appe pan.",
    "Serve hot with your favourite dip!"
